// Buildable module catalog (Sprint 03 · Plan 02). Loaded at startup as `Vec<ModuleDef>` by
// `moon_game::build::load_module_catalog`. Adding a module is data-only — no code change.
// Numbers are plausible-fun placeholders (tuned in It-2), not load-bearing simulation yet.
//
// `shape`: Cuboid | Panel (thin box) | Cylinder.
// `size_m`: bounding dims (x, y=up, z); half-height = size_m.y * 0.5 lifts a centre-origin mesh.
// `footprint_radius_m`: buildability test radius (+ Plan 03 selection bounds).
// `max_slope_deg`: steepest ground (real, unscaled metres) the module may sit on.
[
    (
        id: "hab",
        display_name: "Habitat",
        blurb: "Pressurised crew quarters.",
        footprint_radius_m: 8.0,
        max_slope_deg: 8.0,
